        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "It is an ideal location for a picnic.\nThere is a children playground, tables to sit and free parking.\nIt is long side Lac St-Louis. Bring an extra sweater. The winds are sometimes quite chilly this time of the year, early May.",
